        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our voluntary workers’ compensation business, we assume reinsurance premiums from mandatory pooling arrangements, and prior to 2023, we underwrote workers’ compensation policies for employers assigned to us, in each case to fulfill our obligations under residual market programs implemented by the states in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 12986,
        "end_character": 13326
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082513",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082513-83d6a1b00f43ec90",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082513",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To accomplish this objective, we intend to maintain underwriting profitability throughout market cycles, optimize our use of reinsurance, deploy appropriate capital management tools, including paying dividends to shareholders and share repurchases, and produce an appropriate risk-adjusted return on our investment portfolio.",
        "start_character": 9301,
        "end_character": 9626
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082513",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082513-83d6a1b00f43ec90",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082513",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Using statistical analyses and actuarial methods, we estimate reserves based on historical patterns of case development, payment patterns, mix of business, premium rates charged, case reserving adequacy, operational changes, adjustment philosophy and severity and duration trends.",
        "start_character": 32467,
        "end_character": 32747
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082513",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082513-83d6a1b00f43ec90",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082513",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide safety services at employers’ workplaces as a vital component of our underwriting process and to promote safer workplaces.",
        "start_character": 1957,
        "end_character": 2090
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082513",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082513-83d6a1b00f43ec90",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082513",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide these employers enhanced services, including premium payment plans to better match premium payments with our policyholders’ payroll costs and cash flow.",
        "start_character": 4216,
        "end_character": 4379
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082513",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082513-83d6a1b00f43ec90",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082513",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a provider of workers’ compensation insurance for employers engaged in the maritime industry, we are subject to the United States Longshore and Harbor Workers’ Compensation Act (USL&H Act) and the Merchant Marine Act of 1920 (Jones Act).",
        "start_character": 81762,
        "end_character": 82002
      },
      {
